Farmer's Delight
----------------
Data, assets and behaviour are carried or adapted from Farmer's Delight
Refabricated (https://github.com/MehVahdJukaar/FarmersDelightRefabricated,
branch fabric/latest/26.3, commit 1b85d66f5e2aba88592d7f4fb203d582f4d3cbe3,
version 26.3-3.6.30+refabricated), MIT License, Copyright (c) 2020 vectorwing.
Full licence text: third_party/farmersdelight/LICENSE.

Credits: vectorwing (Farmer's Delight); MehVahdJukaar, cassiancc and the
Refabricated contributors (Fabric port). Courtesy credits as named by the
reference: the Create team (ChanceResult), Commoble, TheGridExpert / JTK222,
AppleSkin, Vazkii.

Two files of the reference (refabricated/inventory/ItemStackHandler.java and
InvWrapper.java) are LGPL-2.1-only. They were never opened, read or used;
inventory handling in this port is written independently.

Canvas-sign GUI textures (textures/gui/signs, textures/gui/hanging_signs) are
shipped as Farmer's Delight ships them under MIT, but may derive from Mojang
assets.

No vanilla Minecraft assets are extracted or redistributed.
